<title>UK: Utd Utilities fall, Hoare cautious on sector.</title>
<headline>Utd Utilities fall, Hoare cautious on sector.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in United Utilities Plc dropped on Friday, retreating from recent strength amid cautious comment on the water sector from analysts at ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, dealers said.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage said they had stated their long-term concerns for the sector but declined further comment.</p>
<p>United Utilities shares, up 12 percent from March 27 to the start of this week, were down 6-1/2p at 660-1/2 by 0920 GMT in thin trade of just 88,231 shares.</p>
</text>
